  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Perfectly suited to a professional, couple, downsizer or astute investor, this beautifully presented one-bedroom apartment offers a comfortable and practical home in the heart of Takapuna - Providing just the right amount of space for effortless, low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, there is an immediate sense of calm. Perfectly positioned in the heart of Takapuna, this apartment feels wonderfully peaceful, with the balcony opening to a soothing green outlook over the Takapuna Croquet Club. The bedroom flows beautifully from the living area through to the ensuite and balcony, with doors allowing it to become a private retreat when desired. The kitchen is fully equipped with an oven, cooktop, rangehood, dishwasher, fridge and washing machine, so you can simply bring your furniture and settle in. Residents also enjoy access to the heated swimming pool and barbecue area.\r\n\r\nStep outside and enjoy the best of Takapuna on foot — the beach, Lake Pupuke, cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday amenities are all within easy reach. Excellent public transport and motorway access make commuting equally convenient, while the established Sargeson Apartments community offers a comfortable and peaceful place to call home.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a little more sunshine, a little more lifestyle, every day in Takapuna.\r\n\r\nSecure you home in Heart of Takapuna – Contact Julia to arrange a private viewing today!",
